## Import

Import uses the existing Library Item UUID. Names and composite IDs are rejected.
Refresh populates state; matching configuration is still required for a no-op
plan. Omitted static defaults can plan changes to imported settings, including
disabling an active item or changing its execution frequency. Inspect the plan
and configure all existing values you intend to retain before applying.

